      "en": "So he caused the LORD’s ark to go around the city, circling it once. Then they came into the camp, and stayed in the camp.",
      "ko": "여호와의 궤로 성을 한번 돌게 하니라 무리가 진에 돌아와서 진에서 자니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d68fb9fb03379738ff21f70068fe312a77d6aad7e14fcb46b7a29382f6802dd7",
      "translation_text_hash": "376d0ed68f0861fe3134d703e021f64fd3768285bd686aab48525333f8d02aad",
