      "en": "At the seventh time, when the priests blew the trumpets, Joshua said to the people, “Shout, for the LORD has given you the city!",
      "ko": "일곱번째에 제사장들이 나팔을 불 때에 여호수아가 백성에게 이르되 외치라 여호와께서 너희에게 이 성을 주셨느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "438bb9f79f3ac52830b3e305b5afa27be99ca2295aeb722786c940f855e56a0d",
      "translation_text_hash": "6c1fc841d6efe3df84c6a21f51225573546f7d3a9dbf58ea11607b65079e7a58",
