      "en": "But all the silver, gold, and vessels of bronze and iron are holy to the LORD. They shall come into the LORD’s treasury.”",
      "ko": "은금과 동철 기구들은 다 여호와께 구별될 것이니 그것을 여호와의 곳간에 들일찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "66c197be134d93ef2e53f89fcfddede27d85f081b1b4fba883dc95314a614c05",
      "translation_text_hash": "7144e0ef7c37f3d3d9d127a852558f4a8462f9940c8dc7bd84c1ba81d18cebb1",
