      "en": "They utterly destroyed all that was in the city, both man and woman, both young and old, and ox, sheep, and donkey, with the edge of the sword.",
      "ko": "성 중에 있는 것을 다 멸하되 남녀 노유와 우양과 나귀를 칼날로 멸하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "46f707e4fac2c55aa650be49da97e704a6f61bf90a76fbc32ce0c00d3ea9b75a",
      "translation_text_hash": "932eb828cc8cf95bcabb9e934951c57cfe587ba5624d1d21306f415b99b674ce",
