      "en": "They burned the city with fire, and all that was in it. Only they put the silver, the gold, and the vessels of bronze and of iron into the treasury of the LORD’s house.",
      "ko": "무리가 불로 성읍과 그 가운데 있는 모든것을 사르고 은금과 동철 기구는 여호와의 집 곳간에 두었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "96ec5913578658921eb78f5f5b95f75bf625f524f4c2ac13a0bd1327fa0e8668",
      "translation_text_hash": "28e436ad82a22a267d0a2e153245ea2f5675873b99496f297fc29b50ebc5c02c",
